This licence covers the game Projeto Névoa: the program, its source and compiled code, its
models, images, sounds, music, text, wiki and everything that comes with them (the "Game").
It is not an open source licence.

1. WHAT YOU CAN DO

For free, and without asking, you can:

a) download, install and play the Game, alone or with other people;
b) run servers of the Game to play on, without charging for them;
c) publish screenshots, videos and streams of play;
d) point people to the Game through the official download link.

2. WHAT YOU CAN'T DO

Without written permission from the author, you can't:

a) copy or reuse the Game's code, models, images, sounds, music or text, in whole or in
   part, in another project;
b) claim to be the author of the Game or of any part of it, or remove or change its notices
   of authorship or this licence;
c) redistribute the Game, changed or not, outside the official download link;
d) publish modified or derivative versions of the Game;
e) sell or rent the Game, or charge for it or for access to it;
f) decompile or extract the Game in order to do any of the above.

3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The Game uses components by other authors, such as Electron, three.js, Rapier and the Barlow
fonts. They stay under their own licences, which come with the Game in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, LICENSE.electron.txt and LICENSES.chromium.html. Nothing in this
licence changes or limits what those licences allow.

4. NO WARRANTY

The Game is provided as is, with no warranty of any kind. As far as the law allows, the
author is not liable for damage caused by using it.

5. END OF PERMISSION

Anyone who breaks this licence loses the right to use the Game. The author can change the
terms of future versions. Nothing here takes away rights that the law guarantees and that
can't be waived.

To ask for permission: https://github.com/lc-leonardo
